Liberation Sans fonts bundled in this directory
================================================

Files:
  LiberationSans-Regular.ttf
  LiberationSans-Bold.ttf
  LiberationSans-Italic.ttf
  LiberationSans-BoldItalic.ttf

The Liberation fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1). They are libre, redistributable, and may be
embedded in documents and applications.

  https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts
  https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

These faces are metrically compatible with Arial/Helvetica and are
bundled here to provide a clean sans-serif body/heading font for PDF
export, matching the on-screen surfdoc viewer's system sans-serif look.
The TypstKit embedded font set only provides serif faces (Libertinus
Serif, New Computer Modern) plus a monospace face (DejaVu Sans Mono),
so a proportional sans must be supplied explicitly.
